  "kind": "word",
  "headword": "insist",
  "ipa": [
    "ɪnˈsɪst"
  ],
  "senses": [
    {
      "pos": "v.",
      "zh": "坚持；坚决认为（或主张）"
    }
  ],
  "examples": [
    {
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "The restaurant manager "
        },
        {
          "t": "underline",
          "v": "insists"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": " that large-scale production becomes meaningful only when the public truly understands seaweed and is willing to accept it as a food source."
        }
      ],
      "zh": "这位餐厅经理坚持认为，只有当公众真正了解海草并愿意接受它作为食物来源时，规模化生产才有意义。（普陀）"
    }
  ],
  "phrases": [
    {
      "en": "insist on/upon",
      "zh": "坚持；坚决主张；一定要"
    },
    {
      "en": "insist that ...",
      "zh": "坚持要……；坚持认为……是……（从句用虚拟语气）"
    }
  ],
  "wordFamily": [
    {
      "word": "insistence",
      "pos": "n.",
      "zh": "坚持；强调；坚决主张"
    }
  ],
  "compare": [
    {
      "words": "persevere, insist, persist",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "id": "c1",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "t": "strong",
              "v": "persevere"
            },
            {
              "t": "text",
              "v": " 坚持（指不顾困难、始终如一、坚定不移地追寻并达到目标，含褒义，后面可接介词 in 或 with）"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "c2",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "t": "text",
              "v": "Not discouraged by his failure, he "
            },
            {
              "t": "underline",
              "v": "persevered"
            },
            {
              "t": "text",
              "v": " in/with his research. 他不因失败而气馁，仍然坚持研究。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "c3",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "t": "strong",
              "v": "insist"
            },
            {
              "t": "text",
              "v": " 坚持要，一定要（多用于坚持意见或主张，后面接介词 on 或 that 从句，从句要用虚拟语气）；坚持认为，强调说（后接介词 on 或 upon；后接 that 从句，用陈述语气）"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "c4",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "t": "text",
              "v": "He "
            },
            {
              "t": "underline",
              "v": "insisted"
            },
            {
              "t": "text",
              "v": " on my going with him. 他一定要我和他一起去。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "c5",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "t": "text",
              "v": "He "
            },
            {
              "t": "underline",
              "v": "insisted"
            },
            {
              "t": "text",
              "v": " that I (should) go with him. 他一定要我和他一起去。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "c6",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "t": "text",
              "v": "She "
            },
            {
              "t": "underline",
              "v": "insisted"
            },
            {
              "t": "text",
              "v": " that I was to blame for the accident. 她坚持认为我该对这场事故负责。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "c7",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "t": "text",
              "v": "We "
            },
            {
              "t": "underline",
              "v": "insist"
            },
            {
              "t": "text",
              "v": " on the importance of good behaviour. 我们强调品行端正的重要。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "c8",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "t": "strong",
              "v": "persist"
            },
            {
              "t": "text",
              "v": " 坚持，固执（可指意志坚决，但多指固执己见，后接介词 in）"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "c9",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "t": "text",
              "v": "Don’t "
            },
            {
              "t": "underline",
              "v": "persist"
            },
            {
              "t": "text",
              "v": " in thinking ill of people. 不要老是把别人看得很坏。"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
